Bug #2 (MEDIUM): Regime panel — ts_us = bar START causes leak
File: strategy_lab/meta_classifier/build_regime_panel.py — resample_to_bar()
================================================================

BEFORE:
    agg = out.groupby("slot_us").agg(...).reset_index().rename(columns={"slot_us": "ts_us"})
    # ts_us == bar START; close/ADX/regime_label computed on full closed bar
    # merge_asof(backward) picks current slot whose features include 0-300s of future

AFTER:
    agg = out.groupby("slot_us").agg(...).reset_index()
    bar_us = minutes * 60_000_000
    agg["slot_start_us"] = agg["slot_us"]
    agg["ts_us"] = agg["slot_us"] + bar_us - 1   # bar END (inclusive last microsecond)
    # Now merge_asof backward picks the latest CLOSED bar - strictly causal.

